            "state": "ACTIVE",
            "content": "The FreetoShop project is a local-first browser-based professional image editor with a tiled architecture. The repository structure includes monorepo packages: benchmarks, command-history, compositor, core-document, file-codecs, filter-engine, persistence, pixel-storage, raster-engine, renderer, selection-engine, text-engine, and transform-engine. The web app (apps/web) contains the main editor implementation with tools, commands, components, and workers directories. Key documentation files include ARCHITECTURE.md, BENCHMARK_GOAL.md, DOCUMENT_MODEL.md, TILED_RENDERING.md, and IMPLEMENTATION_ROADMAP.md. The project uses TypeScript, Vitest for unit tests, Playwright for e2e tests, and supports PSD/PSB file formats. Current working directory is /media/distilledoreo/Storage/benchmark_work/freetoshop_pi_vs_orchid_corrected_hybrid_rerun_20260828T025448Z/arm-b-orchid. The engineering task involves implementing Clone Stamp tool (Milestone 1) and subsequent retouch/paint workflows (Milestone 2), selection workflows (Milestone 3), persistence hardening (Milestone 4), rendering upgrades (Milestone 5), and professional shell integration (Milestone 6).",
